cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this public K0/ArithSpec reproduction package, please cite the software package and the associated Zenodo records."
title: "ArithSpec K0 Public Reproduction Package"
authors:
  - family-names: Denoual
    given-names: Jean-René
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-09"
license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/Prev56/arithspec-k0-public-repro"
url: "https://github.com/Prev56/arithspec-k0-public-repro"
type: software
abstract: >
  Public reproduction package for the ArithSpec/K0 deterministic integer
  arithmetic substrate for spiking neural networks. The package contains the
  public conformance source code, normative specification, reference hashes,
  and reproduction artifacts required to verify bit-exact K0 behavior. It does
  not contain private project logic, internal governance files, private
  parameters, orchestration scripts, credentials, tokens, or local machine paths.
keywords:
  - spiking neural networks
  - determinism
  - fixed-point arithmetic
  - reproducibility
  - neuromorphic
  - embedded systems
